  1194	    and this test file land ATOMICALLY in the rc.3 cure commit, so from
  1195	    the first commit that carries these tests the live file carries the
  1196	    marker. A staged fallback would let a post-landing revert of the live
  1197	    guard pass the pins against a stale mirror. Callers treat None as a
  1198	    hard FAILURE, never a skip.
