# Writes $TARGET/.claude/.install-state.json (next to the ADR-155 baseline
# Ownership decision table — install/upgrade conditional surfaces

> **Status (reconciled 2026-08-09, PLAN-169 — repass-r2 part-e P1): the
> debate HAPPENED and this document's draft framing is HISTORICAL.** The
