  1929	# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  1930	# Iterate over a deterministic list of placeholder files (the ones
  1931	# templates/ writes out) and apply `sed -i` substitutions for every
  1932	# PH_* variable that is non-empty. Anything left as `{{...}}` after the
  1933	# pass is reported with a stderr warning.
